  "final_text": "## Ending MRR, Q2 2026 (April to June)\n\nYou said today is 1 July 2026, so the last complete quarter is Q2 2026. The data covers up to June 2026, so all three months are available.\n\n| Month (end of) | Ending MRR (EUR) |\n| --- | ---: |\n| April 2026 | 334,675 |\n| May 2026 | 344,450 |\n| June 2026 | 387,015 |\n\nThese are three separate month-end values. Ending MRR is the value at a single point in time, so the months are not added up or averaged. If you need one figure for the quarter, use the last month-end: **EUR 387,015 at 30 June 2026**.\n\nEvery row passed its quality check. The data was loaded at 2026-07-01 06:00 UTC, three hours before the 09:00 UTC reference time.\n\n```text\nHerkunft\n- Kennzahl: ending_mrr 1.0.0\n- Art: Stand (snapshot at last instant of each month)\n- Zeitraum: 2026-04-01 bis 2026-06-30, Einheit EUR (whole euros)\n- Quelle: mrr_summary_monthly.csv, Spalte ending_mrr_eur\n- Wer zählt: All accounts and segments summed at each month-end; one row per complete calendar month (row labelled by month start = level at month end)\n- Datenstand: 2026-07-01T06:00:00Z, Stichtag 2026-07-01 09:00 UTC\n- Nicht enthalten: Not revenue, cash, ARR or profit; excludes setup fees, usage charges and taxes\n```",
